Column Name,Description
Bike Name,Name of the bike
Rating,Bike rating out of 5
Ratings Count,Number of user ratings
Engine CC,Engine capacity in CC
Mileage (kmpl),Mileage in kmpl
Power (bhp),Power in bhp
Weight (kg),Bike weight in kg
Price (₹),Bike price in rupees
Value Score,Project-defined value score
Popularity Score,Project-defined popularity score
Price per BHP,Price divided by power in bhp
